Sync None
Create Near
Expunge Near
CopyArrivalDate yes

MaildirStore home
Path ~/Maildir/
Inbox ~/Maildir/INBOX
Trash ~/Maildir/Trash
SubFolders Verbatim

IMAPStore me@linabee.uk
Host imap.fastmail.com
User me@linabee.uk
PassCmd "kwallet-query kdewallet --read-password fastmail-imap"
TLSType IMAPS

Channel me@linabee.uk
Far :me@linabee.uk:
Near :home:
Sync Full
Patterns INBOX Sent Archive Trash Drafts
